  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ff151424c648bce4589172",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到夏天就是夏季英里系列赛！\r\n新潟和中京，一起去吧！\r\n放心！预约就交给我♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6108e593587f1e9adaf85bb4512bfc32780d17bef8f2ee779424dee7591cdecb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ebfce94d597cd17ab44ebf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋天到了！有在运动吗？……我有\r\n很适合推荐给你的跑步距离\r\n哦！它叫英里",
      "source_fingerprint": "3195fc58a2f7bcd158e48cd018453174af362aef5bb643ec5e23ae243ab3b34f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07bc987e6e6fd4c522e4b28e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，你看起来很冷……\r\n运动服，要披上吗？我，\r\n可是完全不怕冷！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2787e0b02bbc96883d79f0f0e29712d5f84ba6cf6734e67dda867e97508bca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b327fa7aabc2c98ef945950",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好，我们大干一场！\r\n……我要成为真正的英里女王。\r\n没有停下脚步的闲工夫！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e3152dd1517e0d55bf2a158f7d6b0853da148bde728fc5495c3864ab0e67139",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c91990eb2ca9c1f490852f35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上啦",
      "source_fingerprint": "25a9ca7fc07775b6f337dde3e4caee9a21bd44b7c35b63b4f8a411502172a58c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f7fbcf06f09143aff9db1f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要是动身体的事情就交给我！\r\n无论多么新颖的训练\r\n我都会一遍就完成！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b697a819a569f45c64ac85d6df9648fe1cdffd184716b2a35a85279012bd2370",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f60eeeeae03bd489bc5ac07e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天要跑哪种英里？\r\n0.75英里？1.25英里？\r\n只要是英里我都乐意跑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f6c016cb002ee1d294084c3c6f0e5e37f34998ae0b61bd5301e134667f49947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b3167d9555ac8d29854d641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "越是辛苦的训练，越要面带笑容☆\r\n……定下这条英里规则后，\r\n我就能更加努力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3fad46dbafd7e53f1078e45398c8a0541c6fb2ca0b6b6415996a52e7b2546c0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bd026089c45e0006c62e63b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿……期待着今天要做什么，\r\n我就提前来了！\r\n期待150英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "005eea7ec37b60e7b63089dba34fa4b7e3f0ba74c3e73dd4ea53feb6ad580255",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dac42525c5b27a2dc6df5b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "当然，英里以外的训练\r\n我也会做！……因为我相信。\r\n那些训练，也会对英里赛有所帮助！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94ea304fb7376770cd2ae1b2e1840e7a85c922dc0119c83043e97931ad39bdda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aeec46c43960cc620127638a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定，会让你这么想。\r\n能成为放声欢呼的训练员\r\n真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "27fadca288bdf25bda7463905c9a54f9cc35310878d1f6b678d388bfda2f8a9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dddb0aa70f38e2e2c397ffa0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，尽情玩水训练吧！\r\n哪怕和平日的训练不同，\r\n我也会马上适应！",
      "source_fingerprint": "65dd88496292580f82e699157c8df57e8155dc5145614cd68115dff94659a979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:112957681f03f9f51f0b05b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在热烈的欢呼中我也听见了。你的声音！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5803c9f1112bd3572644d72eb8e719387f2a3fc195a89d11d42b9cbc536fbdbf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39d455a875903971885f9fe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为是与你一起抵达，\r\n所以喜悦100英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a37f15a5d42df4390061d9e9f3b5ceeb68e514aea65740bb45760b5341f519",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e91c797d41a855b59f7ba2f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "力量涌上来了，大约100英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d046eab4c33ee0131c7ae90f40a4d8309108671c630bd2ce21926aa84d9d4a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f789595409d1f1ba7a2163b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论多少英里我都会跑完！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4ccf11d111939dd96804c0768201feb4ce4e30e7dffcd9cb72f5605a742e1019",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:133409cd4a8b2240185a9561",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是放声欢呼！早安英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "16f6867c7f4838bb8ac001ad2f55cb783570f334da94cb8c4d2db4ae345e3c30",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51a80909b5d14ac62d9fbb62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "长的英里也好，短的英里也好！\r\n我都会称霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c5eeb3e70d50e402cbc3fff997e1d0cf05cd6e1d278abb65870be8d5495d705",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e46c1bc465025a72efff6119",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮忙就该全力以赴！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a7a0e28b2f4ab1a4665b2cc6be110a21b93434f6691ae8e8b62e93ff8759ad2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:951fc45557dd9b5e72c0d37c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管几种距离我都会称霸！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f6d1b2c43dab742a4c3d99b268d34aa4ce89abca763150423c4acfcbdc57974",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929f0dd8e021a1bf8c851f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love，敬请期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8d53e0013b218661ea226bf486a1fc6c9a8a94b46e0f40def4a717589d3a67",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00b9f65ec6c9ccdde44bca6b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能像这样和大家一起前行，\n都是因为有你\n在最近的地方支持着我哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2004318661f2532e35ad77e32231b5cd56110f69f962e9d00d9bbde8306e4929",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55d27141211e8a68d85b6fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dddb4597d900dcb7556f67fd82ff64cf9c9758619073b834862b3b9de804b5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9643449733185bc263d4c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦~！",
      "source_fingerprint": "957219cb55ec945751355da9fccb1ec932616c20f56165eda9b50ec8e13aa356",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c893433df5d0cfff81fa836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总是在身边，\n总是相互传递着“爱”……\n我们真的是非常好的伙伴呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb5a4724467c0dd86d0c8a0f071b29d273167f805f5f0dedd1e61b4f195174f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9a1476b957b84cb711f354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论何时你都是我的“桥梁”。\n我的幸福，就是能一直和你在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9773a3903632acd8a82e1adf854126fa89feacbf28f54f9fa5d5cab3f7aefe6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe8927f86495078da6f06148",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "网络歌合战倒计时，新年参拜\n还有捣年糕，年节菜评论……\n直播都排得满当当了呢~ ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d379320544f34da91071ffe0a8e1e1e29b535de9ce22c9ac32445008c5b288c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:130ed350696743818e978f54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家送来了好多巧克力。\n作为回礼，真想开一下\n特别直播让大家开心啊~♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "63685706453a013a17175daccbdc750d2007383abac9c09e4414f9275137b287",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a85e0862679e1cd5980e03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天给你一个大大的“爱”。\n然后就是白色情人节……\n呵呵，我等着你的回应哦♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "1892d8d88295be6b2e3ade664b7ab2ba75bf24ef564700aca062b61ec996d7ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09250161842528fba89f00b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天的直播主题是倾诉愿望！\nLove度第一的愿望，\n将会获得大家的祝福之力♪ 呵呵♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "9901cfe5d5073609e9e4a596ad9d8912cee81da9655b21d7cc5225566c3becf1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836fbc7318de5277bbeaea68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Love是给予与被给予的存在…\n恶作剧也是，得好好奉还才行呢♪\n好了，该怎么回敬你呢～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ef420b4747035efb1098542dc84b2c46401c57a7bd092d5383a75140eec8dea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:726503082c5d05f503ce403e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给送了我礼物的宿舍长……\n不对，是圣诞老人准备了回礼♪\n不知道她会喜欢吗♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7ad9e18d4aa7b77a757a1b8b6e3a97da35bae48f5f36db96ee333f2b198fda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c22b108461b4cff904170286",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对于珍惜着一年间Love的人，\n作为奖励♪\n今天我来当你的圣诞老人哦♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "216a5675afe6fe992d43563c55787e6db5d5c5c6d2b6401c428e4ee8d162b7e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56b0d21411ff17c55147b111",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦辛苦~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "180ce1330d07eb6c2565e46880edaced3835f0bfd0808e856df9eb4c7496921a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd72b6970a941420c12431b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也是和大家一起倒计时，\n敬请期待哦。……3、2、1！\nHappy Love Year♡",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea768e201ca5a0cbe163af51e551b3d8d561428dd77f31f7869e320e181b97ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ad74b08b756770e5a03ad9f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……呼呼。其实我和社区民商量过\n决定要为你举办生日直播啦！\n主角，就拜托了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd851e901b9c6ac753045dd5de9d3e67b7ec85ff2ec5c5deafb1339881a8e6e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2e98ba209d95daab4115901",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了庆祝你来到了这个世界！\n今天我要送你一份特大的“爱”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a54766c5cd67c1256e202e78fcebc7477043f6e3e482c2a0d0721144212db2c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2ea79ff7160cc338d7a2870",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出生以来第一次收到的生日礼物……\n果然还是爸爸妈妈高兴的表情啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "94efe840be25a1eac6424a2969371909cf91f0ae89097c9730ea93c11cdad921",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:564d8915047873dda9da82af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "格斗游戏要打吧，双人派对要开吧，\n还有蛋糕也……过生日的话，\n想一起做的事很多呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8131f9a9fc416ee7e984d0f911941bbf9c0e42527f9aa8831e43226f7b7aff6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b89e96a700c350c3f5adbd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有通知来了呢。我看看……\n啊，差点就念出来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd92061ffbd16e4f4550f1dde5caec3062046be756d56f97c8d228cbb0ad6e84",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e72c8ac319f68d5053f3c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，礼物送到了。\n呵呵，这也是来自他人的Love呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f59c2baf1416e896b90abc928549204b8f336efb1e25047e17926c2020ea6a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:881472cfa1f32c6f40597d57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成辛苦了~\n好像有回礼给你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "13fdc2d405adbc6abba21c03f9b63152f815daa5a7e7b21afe0cbfb1371cb222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4a4e10f27b96ae0d12fde2e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动呢。\n在今天的直播中告知一下吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d157ee6acabbe512e5719933b8f6d3b9c252e5896c0790e285c75d9f26a7fef7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
