    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dd3a597b68c5db1dd2c5a54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴等级好像上升了。\n这是Love的结晶呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "020bd1721fe95612b0bd23652d177e5b2acf089ab8a2d869fae0aa3b32bf4d57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46a1428b7a4ff2b0da07a2d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "胸口的爱心总是会让我想到爱。\n所以我也给这件衣服注入了很多爱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4ad4419644d3f0245a8a82125aefec57fdcd30c9b497aa1010a4fcf94b9c935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28c48b72176eb5a632548849",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直播时忘记拉衣服后面的拉链了。\n虽然试着用尾巴拉过……\n再怎么说也还是不行♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b4bb23dcb4f2727dfbd64d33a0c0f6e94b63233c61e1c3048c1318242d66591",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca376cc51a479dbdc1a744b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衬衫，是在穿搭直播中\n和社区民们一起找到的呢。\n缘分可以把人与衣服相连。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75d9827a90596fea89743514acf52deff0321cb39387691fa72108e541ffb95e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1132",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f31b8a43da7b43e416ab9b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸亏抽到了好闸位呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "651a71093adbfcd3a9941f767235e16320e3ad4292e28b7dc21b9f58f6380d0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
